# B'Elanna Torres, Scrapper: "{2}, {T}: Surveil 2, then you may reveal the top card of your library. Draw a card if it's
# an artifact card. If you don't draw a card this way, put two +1/+1 counters on B'Elanna Torres." Her {1}{U}{R} is paid
# exactly by a Mox Emerald, an Island and a Mountain. On turn 5 the library is Island, Ornithopter: the surveil is answered
# first, taking the Island into the graveyard and keeping Ornithopter on top, so the card revealed and drawn is the
# Ornithopter - with the steps the other way round the Island would be revealed first and nothing drawn. She stays a 2/2.

